## Detailed UI Specifications & Interactions

### 1. Dashboard (Card-Based Resource Browsing)

- **Layout**: Google Drive / Notion mix grid with search, filter tags, and quick-sort.
- **Resource Card Components**:
  - **Thumbnail**: Document preview snippet / cover image.
  - **Header**: Verified Badge (Teacher Verified icon + tooltip), Category Pill, File Type Badge (PDF, DOCX, etc.).
  - **Body**: Title (bold, max 2 lines), Short Description (2–3 line truncation with ellipsis).
  - **Metadata Row**: Author Avatar & Name, Upload Date (relative, e.g., "2 days ago").
  - **Engagement Bar**: Star Rating (Avg score + count), Total Downloads, Total Comments.
  - **Card Action Bar**: View, Download, Bookmark, Share, Rate.
  - **Interaction**: Clicking anywhere on the card opens the **Resource Viewer Modal**.

---

### 2. Resource Viewer (80–90% Screen Overlay Modal)

- **Container**: Backdrop overlay occupying 80–90% of screen height/width with smooth backdrop blur.
- **Header Bar**:
  - Document Title & Category Tag.
  - Author Name, Upload Date, Teacher Verification Badge.
  - Quick Stats: Download Count, Rating, Comment Count.
  - Action Buttons: Close (X) button top-right.
- **Split Layout**:
  - **Left Side (70%) - PDF & Document Viewer**:
    - Smooth scrolling document canvas (`react-pdf` / `pdfjs-dist`).
    - Fixed top/bottom floating toolbar: Zoom In (+), Zoom Out (-), Current/Total Page Input (`Page X of Y`), Search Bar with match highlighting, Fullscreen toggle, Loading skeleton.
  - **Right Side (30%) - Document Metadata & Control Panel**:
    - **Description**: Full text description.
    - **Keywords & Tags**: Categorization chips.
    - **AI Generated Summary**: Auto-generated document overview bullet points.
    - **Related Documents**: Cards linking to similar resources.
    - **Primary Action Panel**:
      - `[Chat with AI]` (Highlights in primary accent color)
      - `[Collaborate]` (Gated entry trigger)
      - `[Download]`, `[Bookmark]`, `[Share]`

---

### 3. Private AI Chat (NotebookLM Experience)

- **Trigger**: Clicking "Chat with AI" in the Resource Viewer opens an inline panel or drawer.
- **Scope & Privacy**: Strictly private to the active user session; answers exclusively grounded in the selected document.
- **Features**:
  - **Prompt Suggestions**: Auto-generated contextual prompts (e.g., "Summarize Section 2", "List key definitions").
  - **Citations & Sources**: Inline clickable badges (e.g., `[Page 4, Para 2]`) that jump the PDF viewer directly to the referenced page/text.
  - **Toolbar Controls**: `[Regenerate Response]`, `[Copy Text]`, `[Clear Chat History]`.
  - **State Feedback**: Typing indicator / streaming response text.

---

### 4. Collaboration Request & Gating Flow

- **Trigger**: Clicking "Collaborate" in Resource Viewer.
- **Validation**:
  - System checks membership state for the current resource group.
  - **If Member**: Directly transitions user into the `Collaboration Workspace`.
  - **If Non-Member**: Opens **Request Access Dialog**.
- **Request Access Dialog**:
  - Displays: Group Name, Owner Name & Avatar, Current Member Count, Purpose & Short Description.
  - **Rule Enforcement**:
    - Tracks `requestCount` for user-group pair (Max: 2).
    - If `requestCount < 2`: Renders active `[Request Access]` and `[Cancel]` buttons.
    - If `requestCount >= 2`: `[Request Access]` button is disabled with error banner: *"You have reached the maximum collaboration request limit (2/2)."*
- **Owner Notification Handling**:
  - Resource owner receives a pending access notification in their Notification Center.
  - Actions for Owner: `Accept`, `Reject`, `View Profile`, `Send Direct Message`.
  - Upon `Accept`, socket/state updates and user gains immediate member access.

---

### 5. Collaboration Workspace Page

When granted access, the workspace presents a tabbed view focused on that shared document:

#### Header Section
- Group Title & Description.
- Document Link, Owner Badge, Creation Date, Active Member Avatars.

#### Workspace Tabs

1. **Discussion Tab (Persistent Threaded Forum)**
   - Threaded comment posting & multi-level replies.
   - `@user` mentions with autocompletion.
   - Edit / Delete (author only).
   - Teacher "Pin Comment" feature for high-priority announcements.
   - Sorting options: *Newest*, *Oldest*, *Most Helpful (Upvotes)*.

2. **Live Chat Tab (WebSocket Real-Time Messaging)**
   - Real-time text messaging with WebSocket connection.
   - Attachment & file sharing.
   - Real-time typing indicators (`"Sushant is typing..."`).
   - Active online users list indicator.
   - Message read status / receipts.
   - Reply to message anchor, Pinned messages banner, optional Emoji reactions.

3. **Shared AI Tab (Group NotebookLM Assistant)**
   - Synchronized group AI chat instance.
   - Every member sees incoming questions, AI responses, source citations, and suggested follow-up questions in real time.
   - Ideal for group study sessions and shared synthesis.

4. **Shared Resources Tab**
   - Repository of supplementary files, notes, and links added by group members.
   - Card layout: Title, Author, File Type, Upload Date, Quick Preview, Download, Bookmark.

5. **Members Tab**
   - Categorized member list: *Owner*, *Moderators*, *Members*.
   - Presence indicators: *Online (Green)*, *Offline (Gray)*, *Last Active timestamp*.
   - Owner actions: *Assign Moderator*, *Remove Member*, *View Profile*.

